    {
      "text": "A full one-page brochure for the NUS Master of Science in Quantitative Finance, in the university's blue and orange. Panels cover Overview, Faculty, Career Opportunities, Programme Structure and Candidature, Admission Requirements, How to Apply and two student testimonials. A red rectangle marks the candidature paragraph -- a 40-unit programme of five core and five elective courses, completable in 1 to 2 years full-time or 2 to 4 part-time.",
